Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Predict m6A Sites from 5-mer and Context Features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Xiyao", "Chen", email = "Xiyao.Chen22@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: Utilities to encode 5-mer DNA strings and to predict N6-methyladenosine (m6A) using a pre-trained RandomForest model. Provides single-sequence and batch prediction helpers and ships the example model under 'inst/extdata'.
